OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies 'left in the dark' over
OL,4,Acouncil plan to axe day care centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of people with dementia say
OL,7,Fthey have been "left in the dark" after
OL,8,FGlasgow City Council agreed to close
OL,9,Fmore than half of its senior day care
OL,10,Fcentres.
OL,12,FThe local authority is cutting the
OL,13,Fnumber of centres - which provide care,
OL,14,Fsupport and activities for dementia
OL,15,Fsufferers and others with serious
OL,16,Fhealth issues - from 10 to four in a
OL,17,Fbid to save money.
OL,19,FRelatives of those who use the services
OL,20,Ffear staff at the remaining centres
OL,21,Fwill be overwhelmed and that care could
OL,22,Fsuffer as a result.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
