OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies 'left in the dark' over
OL,4,Acouncil plan to axe day care centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council says the services are
OL,7,Frunning below capacity and that it will
OL,8,Fensure the needs of users will inform
OL,9,Fthe final shape of the service.
